{"2516650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The M/S Cornelia II Incident", "steam_appid": 2516650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/732a9d4b3d9a7c69210c0f8b1ced7a20.poster.avif?t=1764083969\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/732a9d4b3d9a7c69210c0f8b1ced7a20.webm?t=1764083969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/732a9d4b3d9a7c69210c0f8b1ced7a20.mp4?t=1764083969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a cold, barren skerry somewhere in the Nordic Archipelago, a man wakes up without any memories of where he is, what happened to him, or <i>who</i> he is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cellphone gives off a flashing green light, revealing itself in the snow close to him. It will become vital when gathering his past memories, figuring out what is going on, and making decisions on what he must do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The M/S Cornelia II incident is a mystery point-and-click adventure game in a contemporary setting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay consists of regular elements of adventure gaming, such as exploring surroundings and using/combining items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original aspect of the game is collecting memory fragments and clues in your surroundings to help puzzle together your past in a room set in your mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/3e9b0c6a90c1e934fe7d83d0890e14d2.poster.avif?t=1764083969\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/3e9b0c6a90c1e934fe7d83d0890e14d2.webm?t=1764083969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/3e9b0c6a90c1e934fe7d83d0890e14d2.mp4?t=1764083969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combines retro hand-made pixel art with a more modern UI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging logical and lateral thinking puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-2 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/1a284c7ff37062b173081ddafae01370.poster.avif?t=1764083969\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/1a284c7ff37062b173081ddafae01370.webm?t=1764083969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/1a284c7ff37062b173081ddafae01370.mp4?t=1764083969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/732a9d4b3d9a7c69210c0f8b1ced7a20.poster.avif?t=1764083969\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/732a9d4b3d9a7c69210c0f8b1ced7a20.webm?t=1764083969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/732a9d4b3d9a7c69210c0f8b1ced7a20.mp4?t=1764083969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a cold, barren skerry somewhere in the Nordic Archipelago, a man wakes up without any memories of where he is, what happened to him, or <i>who</i> he is.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cellphone gives off a flashing green light, revealing itself in the snow close to him. It will become vital when gathering his past memories, figuring out what is going on, and making decisions on what he must do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The M/S Cornelia II incident is a mystery point-and-click adventure game in a contemporary setting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay consists of regular elements of adventure gaming, such as exploring surroundings and using/combining items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original aspect of the game is collecting memory fragments and clues in your surroundings to help puzzle together your past in a room set in your mind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/3e9b0c6a90c1e934fe7d83d0890e14d2.poster.avif?t=1764083969\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/3e9b0c6a90c1e934fe7d83d0890e14d2.webm?t=1764083969\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2516650/extras/3e9b0c6a90c1e934fe7d83d0890e14d2.mp4?t=1764083969\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combines retro hand-made pixel art with a more modern UI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging logical an